~ quest_start
Vera: Are you good with math?
if GlobalVars.mathew_algebra_finished:
	- Mathew said so!
		Vera: Oh my god!
		Vera: You passed Mathew's enigmas?
		Vera: Could you please give me the answers? [speed=1.5][font_size=12] I really want them to see me, but I'm not good at math.
		- Yeah!
		- No, you should learn math yourself
			Vera: [font_size=15] Mathew told me that they'll teach me whenever I pass his enigmas
			Vera: But I don't want to fail!
			- Ok, ok, you convinced me
		Vera: Oh my god, thank you!
		=> quest
	- Of course!
	- Meh... Not my cup of tea
		Vera: Oh... That's okay, maybe you can learn and come back to help me? [font_size=30] [wave amp=20 freq=5] please [/wave]
		=> END
elif GlobalVars.mathew_algebra_has_failed:
	- No, I failed Mathew's enigmas 
		=> quest_start_accept
	- Of course!
		=> quest_start_accept
	- Meh... Not my cup of tea
		Vera: Oh... That's okay, maybe you can learn and come back to help me? [font_size=30] [wave amp=20 freq=5] please [/wave]
		=> END
else:
	- Of course!
		=> quest_start_accept
	- Meh... Not my cup of tea
		Vera: Oh... That's okay, maybe you can learn and come back to help me? [font_size=30] [wave amp=20 freq=5] please [/wave]
		=> END
=> END

~ quest_start_accept
Vera: Is that so?
Vera: Oh my god, this must be my lucky day!
Vera: Do you know Mathew?
if GlobalVars.mathew_algebra_visited:
	- Yeah
	- Sadly...
	Vera: [speed=1.5][font_size=10] What an awesome cutie patootie!
else:
	- No
	- Mathew?
	Vera: He's the awesomest person I know!
	Vera: But he only thinks about math! [speed=1.5][font_size=10] And I wished he thought about me too
Vera: He said he'd teach me math when I solve his enigmas.
Vera: [shake rate=10 level=20] But I suck at math!
Vera: Can you solve his enigmas, and give me the answers?
Vera: [font_size=30] [wave amp=20 freq=5] PLEASE?
- Yeah, no problem
- Hhh... Okay
- I mean, why not?
Vera: Thank you very much!
$> title = "quest_comeback"
=> END

~ quest_start_reject
Vera: Oh... That's okay, maybe you can learn and come back to help me? [font_size=30] [wave amp=20 freq=5] PLEASE? [/wave]
=> END

~ quest_comeback
=> quest_comeback_p2

~ quest_comeback75
Vera: Who's there?
- It's me
- ...
	=> END
Vera: Oh, right!
=> quest_comeback

~ quest_comeback_p2
Vera: [shake rate=5 level=5] Did you do it?
if GlobalVars.mathew_algebra_finished:
	- Yeah
	Vera: Awesome!
	=> quest
elif GlobalVars.mathew_algebra_has_failed:
	- I tried...
	- His enigmas are too difficult...
	- Can you help me with an enigma?
		Vera: What enigma?
		- 1 + 1
			Vera: I think the answer is 2
		- 6 × 7
			Vera: I think the answer is 42, but I'm not sure!
		- 5 × 2 + 3
			Vera: I think the answer is 16, but I'm not sure!
		- Something else
			Vera: ... [next = auto]
			Vera: I... I don't really know...
		- What's the meaning of life?
			Vera: ... [next = auto]
			Vera: Let's stick to math, will you
		Vera: Anyways! [next = auto]
else:
	- No
	- I can't seem to find him
		Vera: He should be around (position de math)
Vera: I know you can do it!
Vera: I trust you!
if GlobalVars.eow_meter > 0.75:
	Vera: But if you could hurry up. I feel like we don't have much more time.
elif GlobalVars.eow_meter > 0.6:
	Vera: But if you could do it today, it would be better. I feel odd.
=> END

